        <p source="#source-30626-30722"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-30626-30722" corresp="#source-30653-30722"><seg source="#source-30626-30653">（昭和十二年十月）</seg></hi></p>
      </div>
